  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Punta Cana Biomass and Waste-to-Energy Plant, through Global Energy Solutions, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to determine the viability of a proposed mixed biomass and refuse-derived fuel energy plant near Punta Cana, Dominican Republic. This feasibility study would evaluate the sources and suitability of fuel stocks and provide estimates of capital and operating costs.</narrative>
  </description>
